I got to level 27 in the latest version of nethack 3.? with the latest
patches on a hp9000 running unix. The only reason I lost was that I 
stepped on a level transporter before I finished eating a black dragon
which would have given immunity in hell. The reason I got so far was
that I found an object that helped me deal with a horde of attacking
monsters. The object had infinite uses, and it gave me credit for 
killing monsters; something that the following objects don't give:
scroll of taming and genocide, wands, and ring of conflict. Without
this object I don't think anybody can win this game. I decline to 
mention the name of this object as it could be a programming error,
which would be fixed in later patches.


